OL,3,GNEWSAChurch purchase plan would honour
OL,4,A'Scotland's forgotten Einstein'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a small south of Scotland village
OL,7,Fyou can find the grave of a giant
OL,8,Ffigure in the scientific world.
OL,10,FJames Clerk Maxwell's final resting
OL,11,Fplace is in the church graveyard at
OL,12,FParton - situated about midway between
OL,13,FCastle Douglas and New Galloway.
OL,15,FDescribed as "Scotland's forgotten
OL,16,FEinstein", his work paved the way for
OL,17,Fmany of the modern devices we take for
OL,18,Fgranted, such as mobile phones, radio
OL,19,Fand television.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
