OL,3,GNEWSAChurch purchase plan would honour
OL,4,A'Scotland's forgotten Einstein'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the area faces an uncertain
OL,7,Ffuture with Parton Kirk no longer
OL,8,Fneeded by the Church of Scotland and
OL,9,Fpotentially going up for sale on the
OL,10,Fopen market.
